{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Roses Shoot Red, Violets Shoot Blue",
    "steam_appid": 2856880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856880/extras/a9e154a34cdb9e63b73440532d54a205.avif?t=1750796079\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rose and Violet in an exciting twin-stick shooter... with a twist! <br>Match your shots to enemy colors and test your skills in this intense single-player challenge. Outsmart foes, take down mighty bosses, and reclaim your lost kingdom in a flower-themed adventure with global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both Rose and Violet with a single controller, coordinating your shots using the analog sticks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in co-op mode as two players by sharing the controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the bravest knights in the Flower Kingdom on their quest to reclaim liberty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight an army of robots, each with their own behavior and moveset!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up to the top in the global leaderboards, clearing all levels in the shortest time possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of hand-drawn environments, helping Rose and Violet through their marvelous journey across the flower world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856880/extras/a9e154a34cdb9e63b73440532d54a205.avif?t=1750796079\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rose and Violet in an exciting twin-stick shooter... with a twist! <br>Match your shots to enemy colors and test your skills in this intense single-player challenge. Outsmart foes, take down mighty bosses, and reclaim your lost kingdom in a flower-themed adventure with global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both Rose and Violet with a single controller, coordinating your shots using the analog sticks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in co-op mode as two players by sharing the controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the bravest knights in the Flower Kingdom on their quest to reclaim liberty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight an army of robots, each with their own behavior and moveset!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up to the top in the global leaderboards, clearing all levels in the shortest time possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of hand-drawn environments, helping Rose and Violet through their marvelous journey across the flower world.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A single-player hardcore twin-stick shooter where you shoot with two characters at the same time! Use the right stick to shoot red bullets; use the left stick to shoot blue bullets. Match the colors with the enemies before time expires, and save the Flower Kingdom!",
